  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Resilience to Climate Change and Natural Hazards Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are to: (i) integrate climate change adaptation and disaster risk reduction across the Recipient&#x2019;s sectors; (ii) improve climate change adaptation and disaster risk reduction information and communication; and (iii) increase the resilience of rural communities to climate change and natural hazards.</narrative>
  </description>
